iplicity and post-hoc subgroup/eligibility selection remain concerns because no independent validation requests remain, although the main TP53/KEAP1/SMARCA4/MSI effects had prior independent validation. All conclusions remain dataset-specific observational associations, not causal or generalizable claims. I registered one focused PTEN-loss robustness refinement linked to H182, adding screen_roc_auc and MTAP-negative restrictions while removing the PIK3CA-wild-type constraint, to test whether PTEN-loss-associated stronger dependency persists in higher-quality clean contexts irrespective of PIK3CA mutation status.",
